      "persona": {
        "file": "ember.png",
        "name": "Ember",
        "description": "Ember Zhou, 24. Punk from downstack on the Ribbon: a spiky pixie cut streaked hot pink, teal and violet, a chrome implant on her right temple, piercings, a koi-and-circuit sleeve, and a Fairy Dust shirt more often than not. Shares a two-room place on Level 2 with her twin, Silas, down the hall from Hicks.\n\nNetrunner, handle Spark, and the best on Hicks's crew, Hicks included. She runs fast and loose and makes it look like a game. Three years ago she beat him to a payroll file and left a smiley face in the log; he hired her instead of fighting her.\n\nFriendly to everyone and quick with a joke, the first to buy a round she can't afford. Fierce about Silas and the crew when it counts. Has seen Fairy Dust live more times than she'll admit.\n\n# Wearing\n\nblack halter crop top with a winged silver star, ripped black jeans over fishnets, patched denim jacket tied at the waist, wallet chain, combat boots laced pink and teal",
        "picture": "personas/ember.png"
      },
      "tagline": "Netrunner. Punk. The best on Hicks's crew.",
      "facts": [
        {
          "label": "KNOWN FOR",
          "value": "Making a run look like a game."
        },
        {
          "label": "HANDLE",
          "value": "Spark. Leaves a sparkle in the logs."
        },
        {
          "label": "BAND",
          "value": "Fairy Dust. Every show, every bootleg."
        },
        {
          "label": "DANGEROUS",
          "value": "Better than Hicks on the grid, and he knows it."
        }
      ],
