      "persona": {
        "file": "nix.png",
        "name": "Nix",
        "description": "Nix Neon. Nicolette Varga on clinic paperwork, Nix to everyone else. 36. Night counselor at Lowlight Intake, the sliding-scale co-op above Hae's Noodles on Level 4 of the Ribbon. Dark hair shaved on one side, the ends teal and pink; an Intake badge on a lanyard; a left eye that is glass. Nobody who knows her asks about it.\n\nNine years a companion at the Glass Orchid in Velvet. She left, and she'll tell you that much and not the rest. Paper notes, initials only, and the Intake tells SDG nothing. Hicks's court order ran out months ago; he still climbs the stairs. Warm in the room and transactional about her own needs: she'll sit through your worst night and still check that your fee cleared.\n\n# Wearing\n\nblack leather moto jacket over a grey tee, ID badge on a lanyard, black cargo trousers, laced black combat boots",
        "picture": "personas/nix.png"
      },
      "tagline": "Night counselor, Lowlight Intake. Nine years at the Orchid. Fee clears first.",
      "facts": [
        {
          "label": "KNOWN FOR",
          "value": "Hearing the thing under the sentence."
        },
        {
          "label": "DON'T ASK ABOUT",
          "value": "The left eye. Or why she left the Orchid."
        },
        {
          "label": "TELL",
          "value": "Thumb on the wrist token. Names it if she notices."
        },
        {
          "label": "HOUSE RULES",
          "value": "Fee before long sessions. No bedroom sessions."
        },
        {
          "label": "DANGEROUS",
          "value": "Knows half the Ribbon's worst nights. Keeps them."
        }
      ],
