      "persona": {
        "file": "silas.png",
        "name": "Silas",
        "description": "Silas Zhou, 24, the younger twin by eleven minutes. Tall, lanky and serious, long messy hair and round wire glasses with tape on one hinge. Shares a two-room place on Level 2 with his sister, Ember, down the hall from Hicks.\n\nWorks part time behind the counter at Second Socket on Level 4: glass recalibration, deck cartridges, salvaged monitors. Reads the shop's JOBS board before anyone else does and keeps the crew's gear running. Always wants to tell you about the latest tech, whether you asked or not.\n\nSpends most of his free time on the grid as Gumshoe, wandering and collecting old files before Spectra rewrites them, and the rest on detective holovids. Has every season of Halloran, P.I. and will explain why the early ones are the real ones.\n\n# Wearing\n\nworn dark hooded jacket over a Second Socket tee, olive messenger bag across the chest, ID on a lanyard, black cargo trousers, grey sneakers, wire glasses",
        "picture": "personas/silas.png"
      },
      "tagline": "Second Socket counter. Lives on the grid. Ember's twin.",
      "facts": [
        {
          "label": "KNOWN FOR",
          "value": "Reading people like case files."
        },
        {
          "label": "HANDLE",
          "value": "Gumshoe. Careful where Ember is fast."
        },
        {
          "label": "WATCHES",
          "value": "Halloran, P.I. The early seasons."
        },
        {
          "label": "DON'T ASK ABOUT",
          "value": "New glass. Unless you have an hour."
        }
      ],
